WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:06.883
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Online Class!

2
00:00:06.933 --> 00:00:09.652
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:09.702 --> 00:00:11.223
Unit two. My Room

4
00:00:11.907 --> 00:00:17.473
Let's learn eight new words. Listen, then it's your turn to say it!

5
00:00:18.473 --> 00:00:20.251
Lamp!

6
00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:25.191
Lamp. Your turn!

7
00:00:25.241 --> 00:00:26.569
Lamp!

8
00:00:26.619 --> 00:00:27.769
Great!

9
00:00:28.473 --> 00:00:30.286
Mirror!

10
00:00:30.336 --> 00:00:35.585
Mirror. Your turn!

11
00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:36.964
Mirror!

12
00:00:37.014 --> 00:00:38.164
Super!

13
00:00:39.273 --> 00:00:40.993
Rug!

14
00:00:41.043 --> 00:00:46.060
Rug. Your turn!

15
00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:47.358
Rug!

16
00:00:47.408 --> 00:00:48.942
Well done!

17
00:00:49.725 --> 00:00:51.667
Toy box!

18
00:00:51.717 --> 00:00:57.267
Toy box. Your turn!

19
00:00:57.317 --> 00:00:58.855
Toy box!

20
00:00:58.905 --> 00:01:00.055
Yes!

21
00:01:01.059 --> 00:01:02.755
Shelf!

22
00:01:02.805 --> 00:01:07.602
Shelf. Your turn!

23
00:01:07.652 --> 00:01:08.540
Shelf!

24
00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:09.740
Good job!

25
00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:12.148
Curtain!

26
00:01:12.198 --> 00:01:17.052
Curtain. Your turn!

27
00:01:17.102 --> 00:01:18.025
Curtain!

28
00:01:18.075 --> 00:01:19.225
Wonderful!

29
00:01:20.287 --> 00:01:22.808
Night-light!

30
00:01:22.858 --> 00:01:28.131
Night-light. Your turn!

31
00:01:28.181 --> 00:01:29.835
Night-light!

32
00:01:29.885 --> 00:01:31.035
Nice!

33
00:01:32.221 --> 00:01:33.847
Closet!

34
00:01:33.897 --> 00:01:39.217
Closet. Your turn!

35
00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:40.468
Closet!

36
00:01:40.518 --> 00:01:41.909
Excellent!

37
00:01:42.881 --> 00:01:51.422
Lamp, Lamp, Lamp! Mirror, Mirror, Mirror! Rug, Rug, Rug! Toy box, Toy box!

38
00:01:51.472 --> 00:02:04.089
Shelf, Shelf, Shelf! Curtain, Curtain, Curtain! Night-light, Night-light, Night-light! Closet, Closet, Closet!

39
00:02:04.139 --> 00:02:07.360
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:02:08.044 --> 00:02:15.996
This is my room. I put my toys in the toy box and my books on the shelf. At night, my night-light glows.

41
00:02:16.046 --> 00:02:18.713
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
00:02:19.873 --> 00:02:25.424
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:25.474 --> 00:02:27.598
Lamp! Well done!

44
00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:34.292
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:34.342 --> 00:02:36.805
Closet! Well done!

46
00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:43.244
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:43.294 --> 00:02:46.158
Night-light! Well done!

48
00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:49.731
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:49.781 --> 00:02:54.045
There is a lamp in my room. There is a rug in my room.

50
00:02:54.095 --> 00:02:58.566
Your turn!

51
00:02:58.616 --> 00:03:02.800
There is a lamp in my room. There is a rug in my room.

52
00:03:03.557 --> 00:03:08.257
What is in your room?

53
00:03:08.307 --> 00:03:10.634
There is a lamp in my room.

54
00:03:10.684 --> 00:03:11.964
Great answer!

55
00:03:12.989 --> 00:03:17.670
Today's value is tidiness. Put your things back in their place.

56
00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:19.779
I will try, Ms. Lily!

57
00:03:20.745 --> 00:03:27.363
Great job today, everyone! See you in Unit three. Bye-bye!

58
00:03:27.413 --> 00:03:28.763
Bye-bye!

